# .env IS committed here, but it holds no secrets — only ODOO_URL, ODOO_DB and the
# read-only default. Each person's API key goes straight into their local Claude config
# via install-personal.sh, never into this file. If you ever put a real key in .env for
# local testing, do NOT commit it: an API key is password-equivalent and git history
# keeps it forever.
*.key

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
